  "originalDifferences": [
    "Original EN1/EN3/EN2 roles replaced by fresh owned non-validator EOAs on BP4. Normal0.001 ETH and negative1wei values, base+priority cap and actual personal import/unlock/two-signature API path retained.",
    "Original approximate hex offsets are replaced with the structurally located Sender.S or FeePayer.R low-byte mutation. The source buffer, other fields and encoded data/access-list are preserved. This is semantic signature corruption, not identical historical byte offsets.",
    "Current exact invalid-feePayer and insufficient-feePayer-funds prefixes tighten original broad reason checks. Insufficient payer additionally has a same-signed-bytes funded success control.",
    "All cases now declare workspace-generated node keys with an empty inherited ref reset. Explicitly overriding a shared key dir is outside the isolated fixture; native preflight requires workspace-local generation.",
    "Owned fixture unlock duration is120 seconds versus historical60; expiration behavior is not covered. Each actual signing flow runs immediately after unlock."
  ],
